/E (Fellow observers shared gear wisdom earned the hard way. Two field-tested favorites from the week: a red LED name badge that doubles as hands-free lighting at the eyepiece, and a set of vice grips clamped to a folding table to keep a monitor from walking away in the wind. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [11]
